{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SKQT9 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SQ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SQ from \SKQT9 — the lower of your top honours, asking partner about the jack. Holding it, partner unblocks (as here) and your \SK-T-9 run once the ace is gone. Lacking it, partner gives count instead — read it to decide whether to continue or shift.}

