{[show SE]
[showcards N:SQ, E:S4]

Partner led the \SQ against notrump and dummy plays low. You are third hand, holding the \SJ — which card?

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SJ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Unblock — play the \SJ. Partner’s q asks about the jack, and dropping it says the suit is safe: partner’s \SK-T-9 run once the ace is out, with nothing of yours left to jam it. (Without it you would give count instead, marking it with declarer.)}

