{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SKQT9 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SQ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SQ from \SKQT9, asking partner about the jack. Partner can’t unblock and signals count — high, an even number. Reading it, declarer’s spades are short and the jack has no guard: drive out the top card and your suit runs. Continue.}

