{[show SE]
[showcards N:SQ, E:S2]

Partner led the \SQ against notrump, asking you to unblock the jack — but you don’t hold it. Dummy plays low; which card do you play?

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card S8] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Give count — play the \S8, high from your doubleton, showing an even number. You can’t unblock, so the next-best answer tells partner how the suit lies, letting them place declarer’s jack and judge whether to keep leading spades or switch.}

