{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SKQT9 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SQ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SQ from \SKQT9, asking partner about the jack. Partner can’t unblock and signals count. Reading it, declarer turns up with length — the jack becomes a length trick and cashing more spades only builds declarer’s suit. Shift, and hope partner’s entry brings the spades back later.}

